ocs_architecture_contracts_document_model_note_meta", "label": "NoteMeta", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/document-model.md", "source_location": "L87", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_document_model_note_doc", "label": "note document (content, meta, strokes, comments)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/document-model.md", "source_location": "L111", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_document_model_y_prosemirror_compat", "label": "TipTap / y-prosemirror compatibility (marks, missing attrs)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/document-model.md", "source_location": "L120", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "iOS (Yrs) must read and write exactly what y-prosemirror writes; writers pass explicit attributes because Yjs/Yrs insert inherits formatting from the left; missing attribute means null."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_document_model_block_schema", "label": "Block schema (blockId on every block)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/document-model.md", "source_location": "L131", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "blockId (UUIDv7) lets agents make targeted edits and anchors margin notes and comments."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_document_model_never_delete_unknown", "label": "Never delete unknown content rule", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/document-model.md", "source_location": "L157", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Web editor deleted agent-created code blocks (agentEdit mark inside codeBlock) on open and the deletion synced - data loss; nodes failing schema checks are shown without invalid marks or as placeholder and kept as is."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_document_model_one_title_rule", "label": "One title rule and deterministic title repair", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/document-model.md", "source_location": "L159", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Clients wrote an empty title into notes not yet received from server, leading to two titles after merge and the real title demoted to paragraph; repair runs in fixed order (empty duplicate titles, empty paragraphs before title, restore older paragraph into empty title, leave empty doc) in one idempotent transaction."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_document_model_inline_marks", "label": "Inline nodes and marks (noteLink, tag, agentEdit, link)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/document-model.md", "source_location": "L172", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_document_model_comments", "label": "Comment", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/document-model.md", "source_location": "L198", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_document_model_derived_data", "label": "Derived data (task index, full-text search, backlinks, tags)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/document-model.md", "source_location": "L200", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Built locally by each client because the server cannot see content; tags must contain at least one letter."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_contracts_document_model_format_version", "label": "formatVersion (read-only on newer)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/contracts/document-m